comment6.target=void\ act()
comment6.text=\r\n\ Act\ -\ do\ whatever\ the\ Entity\ wants\ to\ do.\ This\ method\ is\ called\ whenever\r\n\ the\ 'Act'\ or\ 'Run'\ button\ gets\ pressed\ in\ the\ environment.\r\n
