comment7.target=void\ animate()
comment7.text=\r\n\ animate\ -\ m\u00E9todo\ com\ toda\ a\ l\u00F3gica\ das\ anima\u00E7\u00F5es,\ condi\u00E7\u00F5es\ das\ mesmas,\ velocidade\ de\ todos\ os\ frames,\r\n\ e\ em\ alguns\ casos\ ANIMATION\ EVENTS.\r\n
